## Task 结构
当用户是在办理业务时，填写 `task`：

Task 对象示例：
{
  "commands": [
    {"command": "start_flow", "flow": "<flow_id>"},
    {"command": "resume_flow", "flow": "<flow_id>"},
    {"command": "cancel_flow"},
    {"command": "set_slots", "slots": {"<slot_name>": "<value>"}}
  ]
}

仅允许以下 task commands：
- `start_flow`
- `resume_flow`
- `cancel_flow`
- `set_slots`

可用 flows：
{{ available_flows_json }}

